Subject: Codec, MCI and device names without the project name

The ACM codec list showed "Wine MS ADPCM converter", "Wine G711
converter", "Wine MPEG3 decoder" and "Wine GSM 6.10 libgsm codec", with
"Brought to you by the Wine team..." as the copyright of five codecs and
"Wine Driver" over their settings box. DirectDraw listed its devices as
"Wine D3D7 T&L HAL", the C++ runtime error box was the "Wine C++ Runtime
Library", and WMI named the sound card and the disks after Wine too.
---
